WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.095
Rat and Mole were lost in the forest.

2
00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:22.621
It was cold, but they tried to be cheerful.

3
00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:28.219
"I've seen that tree over there before," said Rat.

4
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.495
Then he shook his head.

5
00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:34.300
"No, I guess not."

6
00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:38.562
"That round rock looks familiar," said Mole.

7
00:00:38.563 --> 00:00:41.213
"Good for you, Mole," said Rat.

8
00:00:41.214 --> 00:00:44.294
They walked over to a big rock.

9
00:00:44.295 --> 00:00:49.403
"It's not the one I thought," sighed Mole.

10
00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:54.472
"We'll find the way," said Rat. "Don't worry."

11
00:00:54.473 --> 00:00:58.672
But Rat knew they were in trouble.

12
00:00:58.673 --> 00:01:05.001
All they could see was white snow and black trees.

13
00:01:05.002 --> 00:01:10.136
They kept walking for hours.

14
00:01:10.137 --> 00:01:13.889
"Let's rest a minute," said Rat.

15
00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:17.401
Rat sat down on a fallen tree.

16
00:01:17.402 --> 00:01:23.145
They were tired, hungry, and very cold.

17
00:01:23.146 --> 00:01:27.684
"We can't stay here long," said Mole.

18
00:01:27.685 --> 00:01:30.359
"The snow will get too deep."

19
00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:34.608
Mole held out his hand for his friend.

20
00:01:34.609 --> 00:01:36.554
Rat took it.

21
00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:39.973
"Thank you," he said, and stood.

22
00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:42.754
They walked a little further.

23
00:01:42.755 --> 00:01:45.074
"Look, Mole," said Rat.

24
00:01:45.075 --> 00:01:48.096
"There's a small valley ahead of us.

25
00:01:48.097 --> 00:01:53.651
Maybe it has a dry place where we can rest."

26
00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:56.609
"That's a good idea," said Mole.

27
00:01:56.610 --> 00:02:01.886
The wind blew hard and the snow fell thick.

28
00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:05.029
The two friends went into the valley.

29
00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:10.629
They searched for a dry hole or an empty cave.

30
00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:14.740
Suddenly Mole tripped and fell.

31
00:02:14.741 --> 00:02:18.874
"Ow! My leg!" he cried.

32
00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:22.639
He held his leg in his paws.

33
00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.218
It was bleeding.
